@best-practices.composition-over-inheritance

Purpose:
  Prefer composition for flexibility.

Owns: references\best-practices\composition-over-inheritance.sdd
UseWhen:
  - need flexible behavior combination
  - inheritance hierarchy is deep
  - multiple variants needed

AvoidWhen:
  - simple is-a relationship
  - framework requires inheritance

Why:
  Composition provides runtime flexibility and avoids fragile base class problem.

Related:
  @best-practices.solid
  @best-practices.dry

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
